{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e09eff057530f5d08aa018c71f9327f543076a60d325ff9c97c9a0ec2fbb8eae", "ja": "（今日は星梨花も出演している教育番組\n『☆ピコピコプラネット☆』の収録日だ）", "zh": "（今天是星梨花也有参加的教育节目，\n《☆PIKO PIKO PLANET☆》的录影日。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "b0ce27c99414590c59a923eb9e70c6191f20f9b1e69c116d7404bc057436e035", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\nもう少しでスタジオにつきますよね？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，\n就快要到摄影棚了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3c6a35f4c83079011df86f62800b5be2725cd549eb210ae447d095214f29d27d", "ja": "あれ？　今日は初めてのスタジオのはずだけど……\n星梨花、よく知ってるな？", "zh": "咦？今天录影的摄影棚之前应该没去过……\n星梨花，你对路很熟吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "184275b79564b007be56f6560c2682fae52ff36e96794ffdee4d9b6f42490e33", "ja": "はい！　あの、もしよかったら、ここからは\nわたしが道案内をしてもいいですか？", "zh": "是的！那个，如果不嫌弃的话，\n接下来可以由我带路吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "36bd2f691916292a475445cb24b48c3310ed18a4b5437f7c0e0c0c1d442a0865", "ja": "わたし、今日のスタジオのこと、\n地図で調べてきたんです。これがそのノートです。", "zh": "我在地图上查过今天的摄影棚。\n这就是我做的笔记。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fe3ef0721eb89de1880ffc7157fc27b895d056e98356a4efcd15e1fe6bd38fb9", "ja": "どれどれ……。おお、すごいじゃないか！\nこれならすぐスタジオにたどり着けそうだ。", "zh": "我看看……哦哦，很详细嘛！\n这样应该马上就能到摄影棚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "489976ae86988a8d23b6a235ad459aaffced4bd35427724999f91870d1086c8e", "ja": "本当ですか？　よかった……♪\nがんばって調べたかいがありました！", "zh": "真的吗？太好了……\n不枉费我有努力调查！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2d9c630400e1cdb7c259de1ed503b31927037e00e385eb3e8dacfe46d8ad183d", "ja": "ん？　このノート、他にもいろんなことが\n書いてあるんだな。ええと……", "zh": "嗯？这份笔记上还写了很多东西呢。\n我看看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6dd1513cd8d215644dcc06c76ced0885d32dabb3e2030fd7e80169bdbdc8a56d", "ja": "猫のしつけ方？　こっちは……地球の仕組み？", "zh": "训练猫的方式？这边是……地球的构造？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "c265b3d27bf7ccb6cae51effe31847e357c38b17c9b2668d147b27789bcec421", "ja": "そうなんです。今回の番組の収録中、わたし、\n子ども達にいろいろなことを聞かれるんです。", "zh": "没错，在这次的节目录影中，\n小朋友们总会问我各种问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "c6e06d17b03392b09fe73585924498f51ace1304da47500b8fe84806a6036a90", "ja": "最初は、わからないことばっかりで。\nでも一緒に考えたり、調べてお話ししていたら……。", "zh": "我一开始全都回答不出来，\n但跟他们一起思考，或是查完后告诉他们答案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "12735ade60c91beef40e3da6c62c853b859ea6e201848a3fd0571f019e805147", "ja": "みんな、とっても喜んでくれたんです♪　だから\nまた、いつでもお話しできるようになりたいと思って。", "zh": "大家就非常高兴♪\n所以我希望自己随时都能为他们解答。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1012_p", "source_sha256": "085088009fc70cbcd8de4189c6d2fd4610590efeee8795e117d382957b8fd287", "ja": "そうだったのか……。きっと子ども達も喜んで\nくれるだろうな。えらいぞ星梨花！", "zh": "原来是这样……小朋友们一定也会很高兴吧。\n星梨花，你真了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "9f78152c48864eae265c199c77d3db9a7dab2a6bbd5f6aad39d6f437c9819128", "ja": "えへへ♪　ありがとうございます！　あっ、でも、\n調べてもわからないことも、たくさんあって……。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪谢谢你的夸奖！\n啊，但是，我还有很多事查了也还是不太懂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "29de626f45c55d2c32c3ccd67b28f1b97a4e316efdd5516339e47bc6098fd83f", "ja": "だから、わからないことがあったら、\n{$P$}さんに聞いてもいいですか？", "zh": "所以，要是有我不懂的地方，\n我可以请教{$P$}先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1015_p", "source_sha256": "8e3740921372b3138b59e5b1cca58d665b351a6eb48f1cc087ea2a12bd3925d9", "ja": "もちろん。なんなら、一緒に調べようか！", "zh": "当然可以，不然我们一起查吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "678f498a77a9f1c02b3fa9e5a27eafe392541ee2b5f64afa8dbd28fdf9a26632", "ja": "わぁ、{$P$}さんと一緒にですか？\nえへへ、とっても楽しそうです♪", "zh": "哇，{$P$}先生也要一起查吗？\n嘿嘿，感觉会非常开心♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0103_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "812c40b6c7f1940b44d6c0c14149e734c6567917a31966e22937f9133a77b2b5", "ja": "わたし、子ども達みたいにたくさん質問しちゃうかも\nしれませんけど……よろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "我可能会像小朋友们一样问许多问题……\n但还请你多多指教了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
